{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794559306889,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf096b3ffedlSFG4CQ7JPEzA","part":{"partID":"prt_1d411def10025SsgawruqJajyj","sessionID":"ses_e2bf096b3ffedlSFG4CQ7JPEzA","messageID":"msg_1d41199a9001onW0pT0n75nBcl","type":"tool","id":"call_2a6187fcd61240df88f02a5f","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md","oldString":"- **Read-only.** Files are read and SQLite stores are opened with read-only flags. The side-effect suite checks that no read changes a store's bytes or modification time.","newString":"- **Read-only.** Files are read and SQLite stores are opened with read-only flags. The side-effect suite checks that no read changes a store's bytes or modification time.\n- **Contained open.** A reader resolves its store path against the runtime's root before opening it, and opens the path its containment check resolved, so a path swapped after the check is not followed."},"output":"Edited .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n+++ .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n@@ -24,8 +24,9 @@\n ## 2. CONTRACT\n \n - **Exact id only.** A caller names a runtime and one session id. No reader guesses the newest session or lists a store.\n - **Read-only.** Files are read and SQLite stores are opened with read-only flags. The side-effect suite checks that no read changes a store's bytes or modification time.\n+- **Contained open.** A reader resolves its store path against the runtime's root before opening it, and opens the path its containment check resolved, so a path swapped after the check is not followed.\n - **One envelope.** `readSession` returns `{ ok: true, source, items }` or `{ ok: false, code }`. It never throws across the boundary and never returns a partial list.\n - **Capability is the caller's gate.** `index.mjs` exports `capabilities`, one row per runtime with its `status`, locator kind and store root, plus a `reason` when the runtime is gated. The dispatcher does not consult it. The compaction hooks and the lookup CLI check that a runtime is `ready` before they offer or read history.\n \n `loadSession` returns the raw neutral records. Claude, Pi, Devin and DSH also return `injected`, a list of `{ source, text }` for context a hook or harness put into the session, which `records` never carries. `loadSession` passes `injected` through and `readSession` ignores it, so only a caller on the raw path sees what the harness added.\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\",\"oldString\":\"- **Read-only.** Files are read and SQLite stores are opened with read-only flags. The side-effect suite checks that no read changes a store's bytes or modification time.\",\"newString\":\"- **Read-only.** Files are read and SQLite stores are opened with read-only flags. The side-effect suite checks that no read changes a store's bytes or modification time.\\n- **Contained open.** A reader resolves its store path against the runtime's root before opening it, and opens the path its containment check resolved, so a path swapped after the check is not followed.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794559303409,"end":1794559306889}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794559306893,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf096b3ffedlSFG4CQ7JPEzA","part":{"partID":"prt_1d411e33e001DdbtzUIyis5caP","sessionID":"ses_e2bf096b3ffedlSFG4CQ7JPEzA","messageID":"msg_1d41199a9001onW0pT0n75nBcl","type":"tool","id":"call_f773bbca82904f8bb7eb9f87","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md","oldString":"- DSH's `injected` source is the event's source kind, such as `repo-guards`, or `unknown` when it names none.","newString":"- DSH's `injected` source is the event's source kind, such as `repo-guards`, or `unknown` when it names none. A `user/message` with no source stays injected and never becomes a record."},"output":"Edited .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n+++ .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n@@ -33,9 +33,9 @@\n \n - Claude's `injected` source is `hook_additional_context`, one entry per hook context attachment.\n - Pi's `injected` source is the entry's custom type, such as `session-start-context`, or `custom_message` when it carries none.\n - Devin's `injected` source is `system` for a harness node and `unflagged-user` for a user node the harness wrote. The transcript fallback uses the step's own source.\n-- DSH's `injected` source is the event's source kind, such as `repo-guards`, or `unknown` when it names none.\n+- DSH's `injected` source is the event's source kind, such as `repo-guards`, or `unknown` when it names none. A `user/message` with no source stays injected and never becomes a record.\n \n Failure codes:\n \n | Code | Meaning |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\",\"oldString\":\"- DSH's `injected` source is the event's source kind, such as `repo-guards`, or `unknown` when it names none.\",\"newString\":\"- DSH's `injected` source is the event's source kind, such as `repo-guards`, or `unknown` when it names none. A `user/message` with no source stays injected and never becomes a record.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794559304510,"end":1794559306893}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794559306898,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf096b3ffedlSFG4CQ7JPEzA","part":{"partID":"prt_1d411e753001dz5HwvYOwNtJBD","sessionID":"ses_e2bf096b3ffedlSFG4CQ7JPEzA","messageID":"msg_1d41199a9001onW0pT0n75nBcl","type":"tool","id":"call_033906796b114625afbcbdc8","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md","oldString":"| `store_unreadable` | The store could not be read or projected |","newString":"| `store_unreadable` | The store could not be read or projected. For Devin, an open or projection failure falls back to the transcript first, so the code means the transcript failed too |"},"output":"Edited .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n+++ .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\n@@ -44,9 +44,9 @@\n | `capability_gated` | No reader exists for the runtime, or its switch is off |\n | `session_not_found` | No store record matches the id |\n | `session_mismatch` | A record was found, but its recorded id or path does not match |\n | `session_ambiguous` | More than one record claims the id |\n-| `store_unreadable` | The store could not be read or projected |\n+| `store_unreadable` | The store could not be read or projected. For Devin, an open or projection failure falls back to the transcript first, so the code means the transcript failed too |\n \n ---\n \n ## 3. FILES\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md\",\"oldString\":\"| `store_unreadable` | The store could not be read or projected |\",\"newString\":\"| `store_unreadable` | The store could not be read or projected. For Devin, an open or projection failure falls back to the transcript first, so the code means the transcript failed too |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794559305555,"end":1794559306898}}}}
